### US3-AC4b — endorsable_flag absent from ref-data response → NO warning (fail-open)
# When reference data returns an offence but omits the endorsableFlag field,
# the offence is treated as non-endorsable — no false-positive warning.
# Expected: 0 DR-ENDORSEMENT-012 warnings, isValid=true.
